msgstr "遊戲正在執行。關閉啟動器會停止本機伺服器。"

msgid "Stopping the local server…"
msgstr "正在停止本機伺服器…"

msgid "The AscNet patch can't be used with these game files. Check Game files, or restore the original files in Settings."
msgstr "AscNet 修補程式無法用於這些遊戲檔案。請檢查遊戲檔案，或在設定中還原原始檔案。"

msgid "The patched game files need repair. Set up again in Settings, or restore the original files."
msgstr "已修補的遊戲檔案需要修復。請在設定中重新配置，或還原原始檔案。"

msgid "Checking the local setup…"
msgstr "正在檢查本機配置…"

