msgstr "用戶端模組已關閉，其檔案已移除。請重新啟動伺服器與遊戲。"

msgid "Couldn't change client mods: {}"
msgstr "無法變更用戶端模組：{}"

msgid "Choose an empty folder to download the game, or the folder of an existing install to verify, update or adopt it."
msgstr "請選擇空資料夾來下載遊戲，或選擇現有安裝的資料夾以驗證、更新或採用。"

msgid "This folder isn't empty and has no PGR.exe. Choose an empty folder for a new install, or the folder of an existing game."
msgstr "此資料夾不是空的，也沒有 PGR.exe。新安裝請選擇空資料夾，或選擇已安裝遊戲的資料夾。"

msgid "Can't read this folder: {}"
msgstr "無法讀取此資料夾：{}"

msgid "Empty folder: a full {} client will be installed here."
msgstr "空資料夾：將在此安裝完整的{}用戶端。"

msgid "An interrupted download was found here. It resumes from the files already verified."
msgstr "在此發現了中斷的下載，將從已驗證的檔案繼續。"

