msgstr "下載已中斷"

msgid "Please wait"
msgstr "請稍候"

msgid "Set up runs source code from the configured repository and installs any missing Git, .NET, MongoDB, Rust and C++ build tools."
msgstr "配置會執行所設定存放庫中的原始碼，並安裝缺少的 Git、.NET、MongoDB、Rust 與 C++ 建置工具。"

msgid "Every file in this folder is checked against Kuro's official files, and files that differ are downloaded again."
msgstr "此資料夾中的每個檔案都會與庫洛官方檔案比對，不一致的檔案會重新下載。"

msgid "Closing the launcher stops the local AscNet server and MongoDB that it started."
msgstr "關閉啟動器會停止由它啟動的本機 AscNet 伺服器與 MongoDB。"

msgid "Punishing: Gray Raven is running, and its files can't change while it does."
msgstr "戰雙帕彌什正在執行，執行期間無法變更其檔案。"

msgid "The local server has to stay up while the game is running."
msgstr "遊戲執行期間，本機伺服器必須保持執行。"

msgid "The launcher couldn't tell whether the game is running."
msgstr "啟動器無法確定遊戲是否正在執行。"

msgid "No game folder is selected."
msgstr "尚未選擇遊戲資料夾。"

msgid "That folder doesn't contain PGR.exe."
msgstr "該資料夾中沒有 PGR.exe。"

msgid "The launcher couldn't save your settings."
msgstr "啟動器無法儲存你的設定。"

msgid "The local server or MongoDB didn't stop safely."
msgstr "本機伺服器或 MongoDB 未能安全停止。"

msgid "The launcher couldn't read its local setup."
msgstr "啟動器無法讀取其本機配置。"

msgid "Setting up the local server and patch failed."
msgstr "配置本機伺服器與修補程式失敗。"

msgid "The original game files couldn't be put back."
msgstr "無法還原原始遊戲檔案。"

msgid "The local server or the game couldn't be started."
msgstr "無法啟動本機伺服器或遊戲。"

msgid "The local server or the patch isn't ready yet."
msgstr "本機伺服器或修補程式尚未就緒。"

msgid "The local server says it is offline or under maintenance."
msgstr "本機伺服器回報離線或維護中。"

msgid "This local server needs a newer launcher."
msgstr "此本機伺服器需要較新版本的啟動器。"

msgid "This local server needs a newer AscNet patch."
msgstr "此本機伺服器需要較新版本的 AscNet 修補程式。"

msgid "The local server doesn't support this version of the game."
msgstr "本機伺服器不支援此版本的遊戲。"

msgid "The local server answered in a way this launcher doesn't understand."
msgstr "本機伺服器的回應格式啟動器無法辨識。"

msgid "The game files couldn't be downloaded or checked."
msgstr "無法下載或驗證遊戲檔案。"

msgid "The launcher is still working on something."
msgstr "啟動器仍在處理工作。"

msgid "Windows may ask for administrator approval."
msgstr "Windows 可能會要求系統管理員授權。"

msgid "Files patched by AscNet are handled by the launcher's own patch state."
msgstr "已被 AscNet 修補的檔案由啟動器自身的修補狀態處理。"

msgid "Stop them and close the launcher, or keep it open."
msgstr "停止它們並關閉啟動器，或保持啟動器開啟。"

msgid "Close the game, then try again."
msgstr "請關閉遊戲後再試一次。"

msgid "Close the game before closing the launcher."
msgstr "請先關閉遊戲，再關閉啟動器。"

msgid "Try again. If it keeps happening, send the log files."
msgstr "請再試一次。如果問題持續發生，請傳送記錄檔。"

msgid "Choose the folder that contains PGR.exe, or download the game in Game files."
msgstr "請選擇包含 PGR.exe 的資料夾，或在「遊戲檔案」中下載遊戲。"

msgid "Choose the folder where the game is installed."
msgstr "請選擇遊戲的安裝資料夾。"

msgid "Make sure the disk isn't full or read-only, then try again."
msgstr "請確認磁碟未滿且不是唯讀，然後再試一次。"

msgid "Try again. If it keeps happening, restart your computer."
msgstr "請再試一次。如果問題持續發生，請重新啟動電腦。"

msgid "Check your internet connection and try again. If it keeps happening, send the log files."
msgstr "請檢查網路連線後再試一次。如果問題持續發生，請傳送記錄檔。"

msgid "Close the game and try again, or verify the game in Game files."
msgstr "請關閉遊戲後再試一次，或在「遊戲檔案」中驗證遊戲。"

msgid "Try again. If it keeps happening, Set up again in Settings."
msgstr "請再試一次。如果問題持續發生，請在設定中重新配置。"

msgid "Press Set up to build them."
msgstr "請按「配置」來建置它們。"

msgid "Wait a moment and press Play again."
msgstr "請稍候片刻，然後再次按「開始遊戲」。"

msgid "Update the launcher, then try again."
msgstr "請更新啟動器後再試一次。"

msgid "Set up again in Settings."
msgstr "請在設定中重新配置。"

msgid "Update the game in Game files, then Set up again."
msgstr "請在「遊戲檔案」中更新遊戲，然後重新配置。"

msgid "Update the launcher, then Set up again."
msgstr "請更新啟動器，然後重新配置。"

msgid "Check your internet connection and free disk space, then press Resume."
msgstr "請檢查網路連線與可用磁碟空間，然後按「繼續」。"

msgid "Wait for it to finish, then close the launcher."
msgstr "請等待完成後再關閉啟動器。"

msgid "Stop and close"
msgstr "停止並關閉"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "繼續"

msgid "Keep open"
msgstr "保持開啟"

msgid "Cancel the download?"
msgstr "要取消下載嗎？"

