msgstr "無法刪除下載內容"

msgid "The {} already downloaded will be deleted."
msgstr "已下載的 {} 將被刪除。"

msgid "Some of the partly downloaded files couldn't be deleted, so the download was kept."
msgstr "部分已下載的檔案無法刪除，因此下載已保留。"

msgid "To keep it and continue later, press Pause instead."
msgstr "若想保留並稍後繼續，請改按「暫停」。"

msgid "Close anything that is using the game folder, then try again, or press Resume."
msgstr "請關閉正在使用遊戲資料夾的程式後重試，或按「繼續」。"

msgid "Delete download"
msgstr "刪除下載"

msgid "Keep download"
msgstr "保留下載"

