msgstr "設定會建置本機伺服器與修補程式，並準備遊戲檔案。第一次需要幾分鐘。"

msgid "Checking that CrossOver is signed by CodeWeavers…"
msgstr "正在檢查 CrossOver 是否由 CodeWeavers 簽署…"

msgid "Unpacking CrossOver…"
msgstr "正在解壓縮 CrossOver…"

msgid "Installing CrossOver…"
msgstr "正在安裝 CrossOver…"

msgid "Downloading CrossOver…"
msgstr "正在下載 CrossOver…"

msgid "CrossOver installed"
msgstr "CrossOver 已安裝"

msgid "Couldn't install CrossOver"
msgstr "無法安裝 CrossOver"

msgid "Preparing the AscNet bottle…"
msgstr "正在準備 AscNet 容器…"

msgid "AscNet bottle is ready"
msgstr "AscNet 容器已就緒"

msgid "Couldn't prepare the AscNet bottle"
msgstr "無法準備 AscNet 容器"

msgid "AscNet runs the Windows game through CrossOver. It has a free 14-day trial; after that you need your own licence."
msgstr "AscNet 透過 CrossOver 執行 Windows 版遊戲。它有 14 天免費試用，之後需要你自己的授權。"

msgid "The bottle is AscNet's own Windows space inside CrossOver, where the game is kept. Creating it takes a few minutes."
msgstr "容器是 CrossOver 中 AscNet 專用的 Windows 空間，遊戲存放在其中。建立需要幾分鐘。"

msgid "The AscNet bottle needs repair. Repairing it keeps your game files."
msgstr "AscNet 容器需要修復。修復不會影響你的遊戲檔案。"

msgid "Preparing the AscNet bottle. The first time takes a few minutes…"
msgstr "正在準備 AscNet 容器。第一次需要幾分鐘…"

msgid "Install CrossOver?"
msgstr "安裝 CrossOver？"

msgid "CrossOver didn't install"
msgstr "CrossOver 未能安裝"

msgid "Couldn't prepare the bottle"
msgstr "無法準備容器"

msgid "AscNet runs Punishing: Gray Raven on your Mac through CrossOver by CodeWeavers, and CrossOver isn't installed. It is paid software with a 14-day free trial; after that you need your own licence from CodeWeavers. AscNet doesn't include it."
msgstr "AscNet 透過 CodeWeavers 的 CrossOver 在你的 Mac 上執行《戰雙帕彌什》，但尚未安裝 CrossOver。它是付費軟體，有 14 天免費試用，之後需要你自己向 CodeWeavers 購買授權。AscNet 不包含 CrossOver。"

msgid "CrossOver couldn't be downloaded, verified or installed."
msgstr "無法下載、驗證或安裝 CrossOver。"

msgid "AscNet's CrossOver bottle couldn't be created or repaired."
msgstr "無法建立或修復 AscNet 的 CrossOver 容器。"

msgid "Set up runs source code from the configured repository and installs any missing .NET, MongoDB and Rust tools in AscNet's own folder. Git and the C compiler come from Apple's command line tools."
msgstr "設定會執行所設定儲存庫中的原始碼，並在 AscNet 自己的資料夾中安裝缺少的 .NET、MongoDB 與 Rust 工具。Git 與 C 編譯器來自 Apple 的命令列工具。"

msgid "It also applies the Rosetta patches to the game files, keeping backups."
msgstr "同時會對遊戲檔案套用 Rosetta 修補程式，並保留備份。"

msgid "AscNet downloads CodeWeavers' official installer from codeweavers.com, checks that it is signed by CodeWeavers, and installs it in Applications."
msgstr "AscNet 會從 codeweavers.com 下載 CodeWeavers 的官方安裝程式，檢查它是否由 CodeWeavers 簽署，然後安裝到「應用程式」中。"

msgid "Check your internet connection and try again, or install CrossOver yourself from codeweavers.com."
msgstr "請檢查網路連線後重試，或自行從 codeweavers.com 安裝 CrossOver。"

msgid "Download and install"
msgstr "下載並安裝"

msgid "Using the game in {}"
msgstr "正在使用 {} 中的遊戲"

msgid "Select the Wine prefix folder (it contains system.reg)"
msgstr "選擇 Wine 前綴資料夾（其中包含 system.reg）"

msgid "Use this install?"
msgstr "使用此安裝？"

msgid "Found Punishing: Gray Raven in {}. AscNet will use that CrossOver prefix and game folder for Set up and Play instead of creating its own bottle."
msgstr "在 {} 中找到了戰雙帕彌什。配置和開始遊戲時，AscNet 將使用該 CrossOver 前綴和遊戲資料夾，而不是建立自己的容器。"

msgid "Set up then applies the Rosetta and AscNet patches to that game folder, keeping backups. Nothing else in the prefix is changed."
msgstr "隨後配置會對該遊戲資料夾套用 Rosetta 和 AscNet 修補，並保留備份。前綴中的其他內容不會被更改。"

msgid "Steam owns this install: a Steam update or file check can replace patched files (for example KRSDK.dll). Press Set up again afterwards to re-apply them."
msgstr "此安裝由 Steam 管理：Steam 更新或檔案驗證可能會取代已修補的檔案（例如 KRSDK.dll）。之後請再次按「配置」以重新套用修補。"

msgid "Use it"
msgstr "使用"

msgid "Found Punishing: Gray Raven in {}"
msgstr "在 {} 中找到戰雙帕彌什"

msgid "Existing CrossOver installs"
msgstr "現有的 CrossOver 安裝"

msgid "Not listed? Pick the Wine prefix folder."
msgstr "沒有列出？請選擇 Wine 前綴資料夾。"

msgid "Choose prefix…"
msgstr "選擇前綴…"

msgid "Existing prefix"
msgstr "現有前綴"

msgid "Use {}"
msgstr "使用 {}"

msgid "Use a new AscNet bottle instead"
msgstr "改為使用新的 AscNet 容器"

msgid "Punishing: Gray Raven already runs through CrossOver on this Mac. AscNet will use that prefix and game folder, so no new bottle is needed. Set up then adds the patches."
msgstr "戰雙帕彌什已在這台 Mac 上透過 CrossOver 執行。AscNet 將使用該前綴和遊戲資料夾，無需新建容器。隨後配置會加入修補。"

msgid "InfiniteLoop is free · Official: github.com/reiserFSs/InfiniteLoop"
msgstr "InfiniteLoop 完全免費 · 官方：github.com/reiserFSs/InfiniteLoop"

msgid "InfiniteLoop is free. If you paid anyone to play, you were scammed. Official source: github.com/reiserFSs/InfiniteLoop"
msgstr "InfiniteLoop 完全免費。如果你為了遊玩向任何人付過錢，你就被騙了。官方原始碼：github.com/reiserFSs/InfiniteLoop"

msgid "Open GitHub"
msgstr "開啟 GitHub"

msgid "Official build"
msgstr "官方版本"

msgid "Unofficial build — not from github.com/reiserFSs/InfiniteLoop"
msgstr "非官方版本 — 並非來自 github.com/reiserFSs/InfiniteLoop"

msgid "Updating the game's patch files ({})…"
msgstr "正在更新遊戲修補檔案 ({})…"

msgid "Patch files out of date; Verify & repair fixes them"
msgstr "修補檔案已過期；「驗證並修復」可解決"

msgid "Use the MongoDB already running on this computer"
msgstr "使用這台電腦上已在執行的 MongoDB"

msgid "Keeps your data. Takes effect the next time you press Play."
msgstr "沿用既有的資料。下次按下「開始遊戲」時生效。"

msgid "Using the MongoDB already running on port {}"
msgstr "正在使用連接埠 {} 上已在執行的 MongoDB"

msgid "Started MongoDB for AscNet"
msgstr "已為 AscNet 啟動 MongoDB"

msgid "Using the AscNet server already running at {}"
msgstr "正在使用 {} 上已在執行的 AscNet 伺服器"

msgid "Started the AscNet server"
msgstr "已啟動 AscNet 伺服器"
